{
    "title": "Messages: Text Message, SMS",
    "description": "Messages app is a free-to-use service. It\u2019s a rich communication service that\u2019s \u2018two in one\u2019 since it enables you to send Chat messages & SMS from the same app.\r\n\r\nUsers can send Chat messages (files, photos, location, etc.) to friends who are using the Messages app.\r\n\r\nBy setting Messages as the default messaging app, SMS service inside the Messages app can be used. Messages is based on the RCS framework which is widely accepted and is the next evolution of text messaging.\r\n\r\nSome exciting features of Chat messaging inside Messages\r\n1. Organise your messages\r\n2. Copy OTP Quickly\r\n3. Share Files\r\n4. Share Contacts\r\n3. Share Location\r\n4. Video & audio message\r\n5. Send Broadcast and group messages\r\n6. Pin contacts\r\n\r\nSmart SMS Organiser: Messages are grouped intelligently based on the type of message so that you can focus on your important messages\r\n\r\nCopy OTP with just one tap. No more switching apps just to view/copy the OTP from the sms\r\n\r\nEnhance your communication experience with Messages\r\n\r\nSimple: This is an easy-to-use platform with a user-friendly interface that enables users across age groups to communicate without any hassles.\r\n\r\nPowerful: Capable of hosting video/audio messages & documents.\r\n\r\nUnlimited: In Chat messages, there\u2019s no limitation to number of messages & media files that one can send to their friends.\r\n\r\nMessages app is a messaging app that enables you to send private text mensaje to your contacts. Message apps are the person who sends love messages and connects you with them. Messenger is a text free, simple message app that can help you manage all your messanger. Besides, you can easily chat with family and friends using the messenger app. Lock messages to protect your privacy.\r\n\r\nKey Features of messages app:\r\n- Mark messages as read\r\n- Send text messages without an internet connection\r\n- Use messages app for android\r\n- Text Messaging app\r\n- Messenger for Messages, Caller ID\r\n- Find messages and contacts easily\r\n- Messenger Home - SMS Widget and Home Screen of New messages 2022\r\n- Group Message with your friends!\r\n- Switch to Dark Mode\r\n- Report: The message has been sent, the mail has been sent, the mail has been delivered\r\n- Stay in touch with your friends and family\r\n- Signal Private of new Messenger.\r\n- Protect messages.\r\n- Message Recovery.\r\n- Scheduled text, SMS forwarder\r\n- Chat app features (RCS).\r\n\r\nText Messaging app\r\niMessage is beautiful, simple, and easy to use for social messenger. The user interface is neat and clear.\r\n\r\nSecure Messaging\r\nIf you're using Messaging - SMS & MMS on android devices, it will integrate with the launcher badge icon to show unread message notifications. You may also set a message reply as a task in Do It Later. Using this messenger SMS app, Never miss any important messages from VIPs!\r\n\r\nAuto-backup keeps you safe\r\nYou can back up all text messages on your devices or send the backup file with an email. After resetting your devices, restoring all your message conversations from a backup file is easy.\r\n\r\nGreat range of emojis, GIFs, stickers\r\n-Use stylish emojis to express emotions or send great stickers via messages app.\r\n- Fastly text 3000+ free funny face, emoji & emoticons from messenger directly\r\n- Text Messenger Chat App support all new free funny emoji & funny face in text messenger\r\n\r\nBlock contacts\r\n-Stop spam SMS text\r\n-Stop annoying people\r\n\r\nAnimated Gif & Emoji Art\r\n- Share thousands of free hot trending GIFs MMS via Messenger MMS\r\n- Share unique free Emoji Art & funny face with friends via Messenger SMS\r\n\r\nCustomize Messenger Theme\r\n- Tons of amazing messaging themes\r\n- Customize messenger background as you wish\r\n\r\nSeamless & Fun:\r\nIt\u2019s easy to toggle between text & chat messages. Moreover, you can check your text & chat messages in the same window.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcde After-call messages overview:\r\n- Stay in touch with friends and family, send group texts, and set scheduled messages after-calls, if you're using this Messages app",
